    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0090","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Nnamdi Gómez talks about why the canvas must stay blank. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</Description>
